### 1. Generate Global School-Wide Timetable with Multiple Subject Quotas (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate-global
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "classes": [
    { "gradeLevel": "{{gradeLevel}}", "stream": "{{stream}}" },
    { "gradeLevel": "{{gradeLevel}}", "stream": "South" }
  ],
  "subjectQuotas": [
    { "subjectId": "{{mathSubjectId}}", "weeklyTarget": 4 },
    { "subjectId": "{{englishSubjectId}}", "weeklyTarget": 3 }
  ],
  "daysOfWeek": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday"],
  "periodsPerDay": 7
}

### 2. Upsert Single Timetable Slot for English (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/slot
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "gradeLevel": "{{gradeLevel}}",
  "stream": "{{stream}}",
  "dayOfWeek": "Monday",
  "periodNumber": 2,
  "subjectId": "{{englishSubjectId}}",
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}"
}

### 3. Audit School-Wide Timetable Clashes (School Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/{{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 4. Get Class Stream Timetable (Authenticated Parent/Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/class/{{schoolId}}/{{gradeLevel}}/{{stream}}
Authorization: Bearer {{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 5. Get Teacher Timetable (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teacher/{{teacherId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 6. Clear Entire Class Timetable (School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/class/{{schoolId}}/{{gradeLevel}}/{{stream}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}